# AgentVerdict OS frontend — example environment file.
# Public configuration only. No secret ever belongs in a Vite env var: every
# VITE_* variable is bundled into the static build and is visible to anyone
# who opens the site.

# Optional build-time override for the deployed AgentVerdictOS contract
# address. Leave unset to use this app's built-in default: V2
# (0xCC67216ceD224A971739bAA706142A740B31853C), the current, actively-used,
# Stage-6-fixed StudioNet deployment (see deployments/studionet.json and
# web/src/chain/config.ts). Set this only to point a build at a different
# deployment (e.g. a fresh one you control). The Settings screen can also
# set/override this at runtime via localStorage, without a rebuild, and can
# fill in V1 (0xb222305575ee8af1255d8aCd196280b405B54Baf, historical,
# read-only, superseded) for browsing its two finalized agreements.
# VITE_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x_the_real_deployed_address
